  "title": "Chrisean Rock Reveals Her Thoughts On Potentially Joining The WWE [ Listen]",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":521237,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/maxresdefault-24-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-521237\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">YouTube</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In November of 2022, a video of reality television star Chrisean Rock walking down to the ring in a WWE video game sent viral after she shared it to her Instagram Stories with the caption, \"Hey guys in a videogame. She tagged the account, \"Meliqbanks.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/nojumper/status/1591949409268662272?s=20u0026t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/nojumper/status/1591949409268662272?s=20&amp;t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The video was posted on Twitter and in the mentions fans began to share their opinions. One user shared, \"WWE down bad, while another said they should of gave her Stone Cold's entrance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/StolenShotz/status/1591949486007676928?s=20u0026t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/StolenShotz/status/1591949486007676928?s=20&amp;t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/DreNyce804/status/1591959113487065090?s=20u0026t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/DreNyce804/status/1591959113487065090?s=20&amp;t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fast forward to Saturday afternoon, Chrisean Rock and Blue Face were on  Cluehouse in the Darkside room when a user asked would Rock be interested in being a part of the WWE in anyway? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"\"Yeah, whatever... Give me some money, if you call my phone, I'm like hello okay... I'm on my way,\" she said.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1614437666056962048?s=20u0026t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1614437666056962048?s=20&amp;t=xlBIW8mCetALfAFF-vTfow\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
